{"4072560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skyborne Terrors", "steam_appid": 4072560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Skyborne Terrors</i></strong> is a first-person horror game where the skies are no longer empty, now demonic balloons have taken over. <br> Your goal? <strong>Banish them from the sky.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><i>demonic balloons</i></strong> are far from regular balloons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They hunt you in the skies, you must either <strong><i>hide</i></strong> from them, or <strong><i>kill</i></strong> them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/09c8227b2c194192e2fc999b8bfa4ca2.poster.avif?t=1783011438\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/09c8227b2c194192e2fc999b8bfa4ca2.webm?t=1783011438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br> Defeating all of these <strong><i>demonic balloons</i></strong> is far from simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You must scavenge <strong><i>sky islands</i></strong> in search of special balloons. These balloons contain hidden weapons necessary for the <strong><i>final battle.</i></strong> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/b655ec3515e37f03d04a3730ca4ec19a.poster.avif?t=1783011438\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/b655ec3515e37f03d04a3730ca4ec19a.webm?t=1783011438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/b655ec3515e37f03d04a3730ca4ec19a.mp4?t=1783011438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Pilot </i></strong>and<strong><i> upgrade</i></strong> your own <strong><i>mechanical air balloon.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > At first, it's weak and rusty—soon enough, it'll become a true beast.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/8a6efeb3d2b29288c4878a67f654c7e2.poster.avif?t=1783011438\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072560/extras/8a6efeb3d2b29288c4878a67f654c7e2.webm?t=1783011438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>What to expect:  </i></strong> <br>  <br><i><strong>- A medium sized open world with handcrafted sky islands </strong></i>  <br>  <br><strong><i>- 2-3 hours of playtime</i></strong>  <br>  <br><strong><i>- Many unique balloons, both normal and demonic</i></strong>  <br>  <br><strong><i>- An entire mechanical air balloon to upgrade and pilot</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Skyborne Terrors</i></strong> is a first-person horror game where the skies are no longer empty, now demonic balloons have taken over. <br> Your goal? <strong>Banish them from the sky.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong><i>demonic balloons</i></strong> are far from regular balloons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They hunt you in the skies, you must either <strong><i>hide</i></strong> from them, or <strong><i>kill</i></strong> them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl